    <string-array name="daily_thoughts">
        <item>Small steps every day move you further than one big leap a year.</item>
        <item>It doesn\'t have to be perfect. It\'s enough that it\'s today.</item>
        <item>When it\'s hard, do a smaller version. That counts too.</item>
        <item>You don\'t have to win today. Showing up is enough.</item>
        <item>Consistency beats inspiration.</item>
        <item>A missed day is just one day. What matters is what you do tomorrow.</item>
        <item>Two minutes beat nothing.</item>
        <item>Progress hides in the days you don\'t feel like it.</item>
        <item>Being kind to yourself is part of every good habit.</item>
        <item>The easiest time to start is now.</item>
        <item>Every check mark is proof that you can.</item>
        <item>Repetition builds self-trust.</item>
        <item>Rest is part of the path, not a detour from it.</item>
        <item>Small, but every day.</item>
        <item>What you repeat, you become.</item>
        <item>A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step. (Lao Tzu)</item>
    </string-array>
